---
config:
  sequence:
    scopedFrames: true
    mirrorActors: false
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A
    participant B
    participant C
    participant D
    participant E
    A->>B: start
    loop only C and D
        C->>+D: work
        D-->>-C: result
        Note over C,D: spans two
    end
    alt B and E
        B->>E: far
    else nothing here
    end
    opt Note only on E
        Note right of E: lonely note on the far right side
    end
    A->>E: final
